 of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs 75 years from 1951, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025 that same pair finished at 37% of normal on the middle of the grids. In 2026 so far, March to April came in at 37% of normal and May to June at 162%. Every grid in the county had its driest year in 1954.</p>"}
